# Only the app's own files go to the Docker build (SF-011). Everything else stays out,
# including docs/, tests/, node_modules/, android/, firebase settings and any key or .env file.
# Keep this list and the Dockerfile's COPY lines in step (tests/wiring.test.js checks both).
*
!Caddyfile
!index.html
!manifest.json
!service-worker.js
!money.js
!group-code.js
!sync-status.js
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!apple-touch-icon.png
!.well-known/assetlinks.json
